Alembic database migrations for Chef Helper.

Each file in versions/ is one numbered change to the database structure.
The app applies any pending ones automatically at startup.

Create a new migration after changing a model in app/models/:
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate --rev-id 0002 -m "short description"
Then read the generated file before committing: autogenerate is a draft.

Apply / roll back by hand (uses DATABASE_URL / DATA_DIR like the app):
    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic downgrade -1
